{"watch":23,"start":6600,"events":[{"seq":1247,"t":6600,"type":"watch","watch":23},{"seq":1248,"t":6600,"type":"decode","house":"rhino","letter":"L275","text":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":1249,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1836,"retries":0},{"seq":1250,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It's Watch 23. My infantry/cavalry are near F1/N-West. Kite is near N-West, but their archers are strong. I need to secure F1 or F2. The kite letters suggest movement towards N-Mid/F2. I will use my cavalry to hunt their riders near N-West and reinforce F1."},{"seq":1251,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c372","house":"rhino","letter":"L453","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1252,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c373","house":"rhino","letter":"L454","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":6900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":1253,"t":6600,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1961,"retries":0},{"seq":1254,"t":6600,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 23. The doctrine suggests making a friend, so I will try to negotiate with Orchid, as they are already in a truce with me. I need to secure F1, F2, or F3. Rhino is active at F1. I will move my units to support F1 and try to engage the enemy cavalry/inf there."},{"seq":1255,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c374","house":"kite","letter":"L455","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1256,"t":6600,"type":"courier","id":"c375","house":"kite","letter":"L456","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6600,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1257,"t":660